{"id": "section-body-16514", "title": "Foreign Bodies in the Throat", "chapterId": "chapter-fifteen", "tocLevel": 4, "tocPath": ["APPROACH TO PATIENTS WITH EMERGENCY CONDITIONS", "EAR, NOSE AND THROAT/HEAD AND NECK DISEASES", "Throat Conditions", "Foreign Bodies in the Throat"], "blocks": [{"id": "body-16514", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Foreign Bodies in the Throat", "runs": [{"text": "Foreign"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Bodies"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Throat"}], "level": 4, "list": {"level": 2, "numberingId": "1219"}}, {"id": "body-16515", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "If the foreign body is suspected to be in the hypopharynx, esophagus, trachea or bronchus", "runs": [{"text": "If"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "foreign"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "body"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "suspected"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "in"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "hypopharynx,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "esophagus,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "trachea"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "bronchus"}]}, {"id": "body-16516", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Take a thorough history and do a thorough physical examination", "runs": [{"text": "Take"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "thorough"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "history"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "do"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "thorough"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "physical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "examination"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1168"}}, {"id": "body-16517", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Do chest X ray to confirm your diagnosis (though some foreign bodies are radiolucent) Refer to a next level hospi